## QUESTION:
------------

Kya hum server-side session state maintain kiye bina authentication aur authorization kar sakte hain?

Answer:

Yes.

Is approach ko

        Stateless Authentication

kehte hain.

Stateless approach me server-side session maintain nahi ki jaati; har request ke saath authentication information / token available hota hai.
